<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-055-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) Figs. 394-400: rhinoceros and allied skulls by coordinate-grid transformation (Osborn) — Morphometric validation: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-28"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Primary pair reports Procrustes, IoU, Pearson r, RMSE/cs, chamfer/cs vs identity, affine, and shuffled-grid null; headline numbers pinned in result.json; secondary six pairs with the same compare_outlines block; sweep summarised in measure_morphoeval. Mixed verdict is explicit: TPS beats identity but not affine. Deductions: shuffled null is single-seed permutation not exhaustive; no KS test; part C3 rabbit/horse remain weak; no real 3D GM for part C4." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
